WEBVTT

00:16:59.076 --> 00:17:02.123
as this one greatest challenge

00:17:02.147 --> 00:17:05.826
that was won by people like you and me,

00:17:06.865 --> 00:17:09.176
who had started acting in time

00:17:09.200 --> 00:17:12.896
because they understood
they had nothing to lose

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:14.931
and everything to win.

00:17:16.472 --> 00:17:17.988
So why not give it a go?

00:17:18.012 --> 00:17:20.235
No one else will save the future for us.

00:17:20.842 --> 00:17:23.285
This is more than an invitation.
Spread the word.

00:17:23.309 --> 00:17:24.519
Thank you.

00:17:24.543 --> 00:17:29.683
(Applause)